Your own AI key — and zero surprises
• Settings → Your own AI key: use OpenRouter, Google AI Studio or any compatible endpoint. The key stays on your phone.
• Cached replies: repeat chats are answered instantly and cost nothing. Labelled "from cache", with Regenerate beside it.
• A daily limit you can see: 50 paid replies a day, shown in Settings.
• Works offline: if a paid reply is not possible, the app offers on-device suggestions and says plainly that no AI call was made.
